<title>UK: Glaxo can market Zyban tablets in the U.S.</title>
<headline>Glaxo can market Zyban tablets in the U.S.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drug group Glaxo Wellcome said on Thursday that its U.S. subsidiary Glaxo Wellcome Inc had received clearance from the U.S Food and Drug Administation to market Zyban tablets.</p>
</text>
